    <string name="insights_plateau_tips">Plateaus are normal. Check protein, sleep, water and activity; talk to your doctor before changing your dose.</string>
    <string name="insights_losing">Your trend is going down by about %1$s per week.</string>
    <string name="insights_gaining">Your trend is going up lately. Water, salt or hormones often explain short bumps.</string>
    <string name="insights_need_more_weights">Weigh in at least 4 times over 2 weeks to unlock this analysis.</string>
    <string name="insights_trend_explain">The trend line smooths out daily water swings, so you see the real direction.</string>
