    <string name="insights_pace_healthy">%1$s %% of body weight per week: a healthy pace 👍</string>
    <string name="insights_pace_fast">%1$s %% per week: fast. Prioritise protein and strength training to protect muscle.</string>
    <string name="insights_pace_very_fast">%1$s %% per week: very fast. Higher risk of muscle loss, hair shedding and gallstones — mention it to your doctor.</string>
