    <string name="syringe_disclaimer">Always confirm the volume with your pharmacist. Overdoses have been reported from unit/mL mix-ups.</string>
    <string name="rf_title">When to get help</string>
    <string name="rf_intro">Tap a symptom for details. In doubt, call 811 (Info-Santé) or 911 in an emergency.</string>
    <string name="rf_pancreatitis">Severe, persistent belly pain</string>
    <string name="rf_pancreatitis_detail">Strong pain in the upper belly, sometimes going to the back, with or without vomiting, can be a sign of pancreatitis. Stop and seek urgent care.</string>
    <string name="rf_gallbladder">Pain under the right ribs, fever, yellow skin or eyes</string>
    <string name="rf_gallbladder_detail">These can be signs of gallbladder problems (gallstones), more frequent with rapid weight loss. Seek medical care quickly.</string>
    <string name="rf_dehydration">Vomiting or diarrhea that does not stop</string>
    <string name="rf_dehydration_detail">Losing fluids can dehydrate you and strain the kidneys. Drink small sips often; call 811 or your doctor if you cannot keep fluids down, urinate little or feel dizzy.</string>
    <string name="rf_allergy">Swelling of face, lips or throat, trouble breathing</string>
    <string name="rf_allergy_detail">Possible severe allergic reaction. Call 911 immediately.</string>
    <string name="rf_hypoglycemia">Shaking, sweating, confusion (diabetes)</string>
    <string name="rf_hypoglycemia_detail">With insulin or sulfonylureas, GLP-1 drugs can cause low blood sugar. Take fast sugar (juice, glucose tablets) and check your glucose; tell your doctor.</string>
    <string name="rf_vision">Sudden changes in vision (diabetes)</string>
    <string name="rf_vision_detail">People with diabetic eye disease should report any vision change to their doctor promptly.</string>
    <string name="rf_thyroid">Lump in the neck, hoarseness, trouble swallowing</string>
    <string name="rf_thyroid_detail">Rare, but listed in the warnings of these medications. Show your doctor.</string>
    <string name="rf_mood">Low mood, dark thoughts</string>
    <string name="rf_mood_detail">You are not alone. Call or text 988 (suicide crisis helpline, 24/7) or 911 if you are in danger.</string>
    <string name="rf_811">811</string>
    <string name="rf_988">988</string>
    <string name="rf_disclaimer">Information from the product monographs, not a diagnosis. Numbers are for Canada/Québec.</string>
